  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "One man worked for America's drug agency, trained with Lashkar-e-Taiba, and took money from Pakistani intelligence."
    },
    {
      "text": "Every time he was caught, he made a deal."
    },
    {
      "text": "He checked into the Taj, filmed the routes, and marked the targets for 26/11."
    },
    {
      "text": "His own wives warned US authorities. \"He's either a terrorist, or he's working for you.\""
    },
    {
      "text": "The Mercenary. Now on The Sisodia Files."
    }
  ],
